The hardware SDK approach was informed by publicly documented Muse Gadgets
(https://gadgets.muse.ai/) and facebookincubator/muse-gadget-sdk. No Meta SDK
source, Jollybot artwork, SDK credentials or proprietary protocol implementation
is included. This project uses Gabriel's documented Persona API independently.

Official persona portraits shipped with the fourteen examples are Gabriel
Operator artwork, included so each example can be recognized. They are not
Meta, Muse, or other third-party character art.

ESP-IDF is a separately licensed build/runtime dependency maintained by Espressif.
Its source, toolchains and Docker image are not redistributed in this repository.
The cJSON component is fetched from Espressif's component registry at firmware
build time and retains its upstream MIT license; managed components are not tracked.
Python standard-library dependencies remain covered by their upstream licenses.
Third-party models, knowledge, artwork, credentials and production persona
resources are not included and retain their own licenses and access terms.
